(7504554, 1195704, 156466, '<td valign="top">Great lines and a good subject for the challenge. A little over sharp. <br/> <br/>Side note, there''s just a little too much lost in the inky blackness in the bottom right. I tried it on 3 different monitors to make sure, then pulled a copy into Photoshop with a darker background and it lightened up just fine. The light grey does this all the time to B&amp;W shots here, which is unfortunate, so maybe double check the appearance of darker areas after uploading in the future.</td>', 'Great lines and a good subject for the challenge. A little over sharp.  Side note, there''s just a little too much lost in the inky blackness in the bottom right. I tried it on 3 different monitors to make sure, then pulled a copy into Photoshop with a darker background and it lightened up just fine. The light grey does this all the time to B&W shots here, which is unfortunate, so maybe double check the appearance of darker areas after uploading in the future.', '2017-03-09 08:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
